In 2011 , Boulter played " Tom " in the play The Pride by David Eldridge , which was performed at the Royal Court Theatre in London . The play explores the theme of same-sex relationships in the 1950s and 1960s . In a review of the production for The Guardian , theatre critic Michael Billington noted , " Robert Boulter brings a touching vulnerability to the role of Tom . " In 2012 , Boulter played " Daniel " in the play The Merchant of Venice at the Almeida Theatre
